    "title": "Namespace Turns Real Macs Into Cloud Servers",
    "source_text": "Namespace Turns Macs into Cloud Infrastructure.\nNamespace is transforming Macs into powerful cloud servers for developers.\nNamespace is buying Macs at scale and installing them in its data centers, repurposing Apple Silicon hardware for cloud infrastructure. This shift allows developers to utilize capacity for Xcode builds, iOS testing, and continuous integration. AI coding agents can now operate in their own remote macOS environments, autonomously building and testing Apple apps. This could redefine how cloud infrastructure looks in the future. If you want the link, just comment macs.",
